        <b>About The Independent Web</b>
    </p>

    <p>
        The Independent Web is a community for people who enjoy
        building, exploring, and sharing their own corner of the internet.
    </p>

    <p>
        Personal websites, blogs, open-source projects, indie software,
        alternative protocols, and small communities all have a place here.
    </p>
